# Build context of the Python images (repository root). Allowlist: only what
# their Dockerfiles copy; the web image builds from apps/web with its own.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!packages/wingman-core/
!packages/shared-python/
!apps/day1-service/
!apps/day2-service/
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/tests
